<title>USA: Minnesota jobless rate stays at 3.5 pct in Jan..</title>
<headline>Minnesota jobless rate stays at 3.5 pct in Jan..</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Minnesota's seasonally adjusted unemployment rate was 3.5 percent in January, the same rate as in December, the state's department of economic security reported Thursday.</p>
<p>The jobless rate for the state in January 1996 was 3.2 percent.</p>
<p>((--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647))</p>
</text>
